{% doc %}
  Cart page (TE-5 AC4, AC5, AC9, AC10, AC14, AC17, AC19; cart.md). Reads the
  global `cart` and the block settings empty_cart_collection and
  show_sticky_checkout. Works without JavaScript: form post to routes.cart_url
  with updates[], note, Update and Checkout; Remove is a link. The empty state is
  shopper content (AC19), shown in the theme editor and on the storefront.

  Custom element cart-items (one grid from assets/base.css: head row, then the
  lines column and the summary column from 64rem) holds, in DOM order:
  - h1 "Cart" with tabindex -1: assets/cart-items.js moves focus to it after the
    last line is removed. Outside the partial.
  - cart-items-status (role status, the first one in cart-items) and
    cart-items-error (role alert): live regions, empty on load.
  - Partial cart-page (name must match the JS): root cart-page-body with
    data-item-count, then the item count and the "Continue shopping" link of
    the head row (inside the partial so the count follows a refresh), form id
    cart-form-page with free shipping, lines and summary, the empty cart
    Bestsellers grid, and the sticky checkout bar.
  - Accelerated checkout wrapper with the "or pay with" divider, outside the
    partial because Shopify's script mounts the buttons and a refresh would drop
    them. Hidden when the cart is empty; JavaScript syncs hidden from
    data-item-count after a refresh.
  - Order note (AC5, always open): label, textarea name note, hint tied with
    aria-describedby; outside the partial, tied to the form by the form
    attribute. Saved on form submit. CSS hides it when data-item-count is 0.

  Sticky checkout bar (AC17, cart.md §3.7; ES1-T490 option B): custom element
  cart-checkout-bar (test hook cart-checkout-bar) is the host and wraps aside
  cart-sticky-checkout; both render only when the cart has items and
  show_sticky_checkout is on, the aside with hidden. The host sits inside the
  cart-page partial, so a refresh replaces it and runs connectedCallback again.
  The host has no CSS: the aside is position fixed, the host is an empty grid
  item of zero size. assets/cart-checkout-bar.js (BE, ES1-T370), whose script tag BE adds next to cart-items.js
  (outside the partial) in ES1-T370, owns the bar: below 64rem it watches the
  summary panel (.cart-summary--page) with an IntersectionObserver, removes
  hidden on the aside while the panel is out of view and sets
  html[data-bottom-bar="cart"] (body padding comes from --bottom-bar-height),
  then restores hidden and removes the attribute when the panel is in view or
  the host disconnects. From 64rem CSS never shows the bar. Its Checkout button
  posts the same form (name checkout), so it works without JavaScript.
  assets/cart-items.js does not handle the bar.

  cart-items hooks: data-cart-change-url, data-cart-url, data-partials,
  data-label-updated, data-label-removed, data-label-error,
  data-label-quantity-adjusted, data-label-updating ("Updating cart…", AC18).
  JavaScript sets data-enhanced (CSS hides the Update button) and aria-busy.
  The textarea sits inside cart-items, so a delegated change listener must
  filter on the quantity input. Line hooks are listed in snippets/cart-lines.liquid.

  Test hooks: cart-page, cart-page-heading, cart-page-count,
  cart-page-continue, cart-items, cart-items-status, cart-items-error,
  cart-page-body, cart-form, cart-page-bestsellers, cart-checkout-bar,
  cart-sticky-checkout,
  cart-sticky-checkout-total, cart-sticky-checkout-button,
  cart-page-accelerated, cart-page-note, cart-page-note-hint.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'cart-main' %}
    {% block 'cart-page' %}{% endblock %}
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign label_updated = 'cart.updated' | t
  assign label_removed = 'cart.removed' | t
  assign label_error = 'cart.error' | t
  assign label_quantity_adjusted = 'cart.quantity_adjusted' | t
  assign label_updating = 'cart.updating' | t
  assign empty_collection = block.settings.empty_cart_collection
-%}

<div class="cart-page" data-testid="cart-page" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <cart-items
    class="cart-items cart-page__items"
    data-cart-change-url="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}"
    data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
    data-partials="cart-page cart-count"
    data-label-updated="{{ label_updated | escape }}"
    data-label-removed="{{ label_removed | escape }}"
    data-label-error="{{ label_error | escape }}"
    data-label-quantity-adjusted="{{ label_quantity_adjusted | escape }}"
    data-label-updating="{{ label_updating | escape }}"
    data-testid="cart-items"
  >
    <h1 class="cart-page__heading" tabindex="-1" data-testid="cart-page-heading">{{ 'cart.title' | t }}</h1>
    <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="cart-items-status"></div>
    <div class="cart-items__error" role="alert" data-testid="cart-items-error"></div>

    {% partial 'cart-page' %}
      <div class="cart-page__body" data-item-count="{{ cart.item_count }}" data-testid="cart-page-body">
        {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
          <p class="cart-page__count" data-testid="cart-page-count">
            {{- 'cart.item_count' | t: count: cart.item_count -}}
          </p>
          <a class="empty-state__link cart-page__continue" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" data-testid="cart-page-continue">
            {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
            {{- 'cart.continue_shopping_link' | t -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        <form
          id="cart-form-page"
          class="cart-page__form"
          action="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
          method="post"
          data-testid="cart-form"
        >
          <div class="cart-page__main">
            {%- render 'cart-free-shipping', cart: cart, context: 'page' -%}
            {%- render 'cart-lines', cart: cart, context: 'page' -%}
          </div>
          {%- render 'cart-summary', cart: cart, context: 'page' -%}
        </form>

        {%- if cart.item_count == 0 and empty_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
          <div class="cart-page__bestsellers" data-testid="cart-page-bestsellers">
            <div class="featured-collection__titles">
              <p class="featured-collection__eyebrow">{{ 'cart.empty_eyebrow' | t }}</p>
              <h2 class="featured-collection__heading">{{ 'cart.bestsellers' | t }}</h2>
            </div>
            <ul class="featured-collection__grid" role="list">
              {%- for product in empty_collection.products limit: 4 -%}
                <li class="featured-collection__item">
                  {%- render 'product-card',
                    product: product,
                    sizes: '(min-width: 80rem) 25vw, (min-width: 48rem) 33vw, 50vw',
                    heading_level: 'h3'
                  -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if cart.item_count > 0 and block.settings.show_sticky_checkout -%}
          <cart-checkout-bar data-testid="cart-checkout-bar">
            <aside
              class="cart-sticky-checkout"
              aria-label="{{ 'cart.sticky_checkout_label' | t }}"
              data-testid="cart-sticky-checkout"
              hidden
            >
              <p class="cart-sticky-checkout__total">
                <span class="cart-summary__muted">{{ 'cart.total' | t }}</span>
                <strong class="cart-summary__total" data-testid="cart-sticky-checkout-total">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</strong>
              </p>
              <button
                class="button cart-sticky-checkout__button"
                type="submit"
                name="checkout"
                form="cart-form-page"
                data-testid="cart-sticky-checkout-button"
              >
                {{- 'cart.checkout' | t -}}
                {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
              </button>
            </aside>
          </cart-checkout-bar>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {% endpartial %}

    {%- if additional_checkout_buttons -%}
      <div
        class="cart-page__accelerated"
        {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}
          hidden
        {% endif %}
        data-cart-accelerated
        data-testid="cart-page-accelerated"
      >
        <p class="cart-page__or">{{ 'cart.express_divider' | t }}</p>
        {{- content_for_additional_checkout_buttons -}}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="cart-page__note">
      <label class="cart-page__note-label" for="cart-note">{{ 'cart.note_label' | t }}</label>
      <textarea
        id="cart-note"
        class="cart-page__note-input"
        name="note"
        rows="4"
        form="cart-form-page"
        aria-describedby="cart-note-hint"
        data-testid="cart-page-note"
      >{{ cart.note | escape }}</textarea>
      <p id="cart-note-hint" class="cart-page__note-hint" data-testid="cart-page-note-hint">
        {{- 'cart.note_page_hint' | t -}}
      </p>
    </div>
  </cart-items>
  <script src="{{ 'cart-items.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.cart_page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "empty_cart_collection",
      "label": "t:labels.empty_cart_collection",
      "info": "t:info.empty_cart_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_sticky_checkout",
      "label": "t:labels.show_sticky_checkout",
      "info": "t:info.show_sticky_checkout",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
